at 2026 08 18 activ histori 2026 08 18 alic task creat open open the task becaus an async batch api schedul is need for higher throughput 2026 08 25 diana i o race block block block after find a concurr i o race that cut throughput by rough 10 depend on the multi thread work\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee7e45908a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-47-Async-Batch-Processing.md\", \"id\": \"6b3cd42efe279a7b\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.5198298973939801, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.4219035534199716, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7483247, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-47-Async-Batch-Processing.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee7e45908a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-47-Async-Batch-Processing.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-47-Async-Batch-Processing.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1019, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:06:21\", \"token_count\": 519, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-31\\n\\n# Engineering Note: Async Job Scheduler\\n\\n**Owner**: Bob\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2031\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-04 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-20)\\n\\nRetrospective note on the async job scheduler added 2026-08-20 to the batch API under CIPH-47, for higher throughput under concurrent load.\\n\\n## What was added\\n\\nAn asynchronous scheduler that accepts batch API jobs and dispatches them to worker threads without blocking the request path, building on the multi-threading work already integrated into the batch CLI.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-31\\n\\n# Engineering Note: Async Job Scheduler\\n\\n**Owner**: Bob\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2031\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-04 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-20)\\n\\nRetrospective note on the async job scheduler added 2026-08-20 to the batch API under CIPH-47, for higher throughput under concurrent load.\\n\\n## Design\\n\\nJobs are queued with a job ID returned immediately to the caller; a separate status endpoint reports progress. Workers pull from the same queue used by the multi-threaded batch path.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-31\\n\\n# Engineering Note: Async Job Scheduler\\n\\n**Owner**: Bob\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2031\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-04 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-20)\\n\\nRetrospective note on the async job scheduler added 2026-08-20 to the batch API under CIPH-47, for higher throughput under concurrent load.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\nThis note covers the scheduler's implementation and design only. It does not cover any concurrency issues found during later evaluation of the scheduler under load; those are separate from what this note documents.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 31 engin note async job schedul owner bob document key doc 2031 last updat 2026 09 04 retrospect cover 2026 08 20 retrospect note on the async job schedul ad 2026 08 20 to the batch api under ciph 47 for higher throughput under concurr load what wa ad an asynchron schedul that accept batch api job and dispatch them to worker thread without block the request path build on the multi thread work alreadi integr into the batch cli sourc id src gdoc 31 engin note async job schedul owner bob document key doc 2031 last updat 2026 09 04 retrospect cover 2026 08 20 retrospect note on the async job schedul ad 2026 08 20 to the batch api under ciph 47 for higher throughput under concurr load design job are queu with a job id return immedi to the caller a separ status endpoint report progress worker pull from the same queue use by the multi thread batch path sourc id src gdoc 31 engin note async job schedul owner bob document key doc 2031 last updat 2026 09 04 retrospect cover 2026 08 20 retrospect note on the async job schedul ad 2026 08 20 to the batch api under ciph 47 for higher throughput under concurr load scope this note cover the schedul s implement and design onli it doe not cover ani concurr issu found dure later evalu of the schedul under load those are separ from what this note document\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"eed7bad08a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-04-Async-Batch-Processing-Review.md\", \"id\": \"e00a9a695a57f07d\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.44304475404230126, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.3416679200604304, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6795907, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-04-Async-Batch-Processing-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"eed7bad08a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-04-Async-Batch-Processing-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-04-Async-Batch-Processing-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 956, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:05:06\", \"token_count\": 412, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-11\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-11\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-11\\n\\n**Title**: Core Redaction Engine\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-01\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild the core document-redaction processing engine for CipherDoc (WS-01): the foundational component that applies redaction to detecte