window defend smartscreen code sign the task remain activ with those two gate unresolv\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee6769568a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-21-Release-v1-Gates.md\", \"id\": \"9446122a438f23cb\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3441596273778035, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.16047126768257647, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7727658, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-21-Release-v1-Gates.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee6769568a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-21-Release-v1-Gates.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-21-Release-v1-Gates.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1139, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:15\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:06:42\", \"token_count\": 635, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-16\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-16\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-16\\n\\n**Title**: Redaction Policy Configuration (YAML)\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-15\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nDefine the redaction-policy configuration system for CipherDoc (WS-01). The format decision moved from an initial JSON choice to YAML, selected for inline comments and readability for human editors, before Charlie completed the implementation on 2026-06-22.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-16\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-16\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-16\\n\\n**Title**: Redaction Policy Configuration (YAML)\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-15\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Configuration fo